Radical openness.</h1>
    <div>
      
        <p class="f-body pt-20 md:pt-40 lg:pt-60">Meet K2 Horizon: The largest fully open-source model launch in AI history, spanning six models that give you greater choice in capabilities, scale and deployment options, along with open access to training code and data.</p>
      
      
