    <section data-component="statement" data-behavior="statement" class="py-set-11" data-reveal="true">
  
    <p class="f-body-lg max-w-[90%] lg:max-w-[75%] text-balance">With complete visibility into model training and evaluations, advanced agentic capabilities, and an efficient cost per task, our newest K2 generation gives researchers and builders the right-size foundation for dependable, long-context, agentic applications at every scale.</p>
  
  
    <ul class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-x-40 gap-y-12 mt-20">
      
      <li>
        <button
