    <section data-component="capabilty-grid" class="py-set-11">
  
  <div class="offset-grid">
    <h2 class="f-h1" data-reveal="true">Well-rounded capabilities</h2>
  </div>
  
  
    <ul class="flex flex-col gap-y-48 mt-set-9">
      
        <li class="group offset-grid border-t border-t-grey-opacity-20 pt-12 transition-colors duration-200 ease-out hover:text-accent-orange" data-reveal="true">
          <h3 class="f-body-lg transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-4 motion-reduce:translate-x-0!">Agentic tasks and complex problem-solving</h3>
          <p class="f-body mt-12 lg:mt-0 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-4 motion-reduce:translate-x-0!">Across coding and agentic tasks, K2 Horizon delivers top-tier performance in every size class.</p>
        </li>
      
        <li class="group offset-grid border-t border-t-grey-opacity-20 pt-12 transition-colors duration-200 ease-out hover:text-accent-orange" data-reveal="true">
          <h3 class="f-body-lg transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-4 motion-reduce:translate-x-0!">Fully open for customization</h3>
          <p class="f-body mt-12 lg:mt-0 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-4 motion-reduce:translate-x-0!">For every model, we release final weights, training code, checkpoints, and data-construction recipes or training data, so you can inspect, reproduce, fine-tune, and extend it.</p>
        </li>
      
        <li class="group offset-grid border-t border-t-grey-opacity-20 pt-12 transition-colors duration-200 ease-out hover:text-accent-orange" data-reveal="true">
          <h3 class="f-body-lg transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-4 motion-reduce:translate-x-0!">One connected fleet</h3>
          <p class="f-body mt-12 lg:mt-0 transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-4 motion-reduce:translate-x-0!">The models share core architectural decisions, training methodology, and deployment tooling. This consistency makes it easier to move between sizes, route workloads across the fleet, and study capability and efficiency across scales.</p>
        </li>
      
    </ul>
  
</section>

  

  
    

