<section data-component="transparency" data-behavior="transparency" class="pt-set-11 background-fill background-fill-accent-light-green">
  <div class="offset-grid">
    
      <h2 class="f-h1 whitespace-pre-line" data-reveal="true">A glass box, 
not a black box</h2>
    
    
      <p class="f-body mt-20 lg:mt-0" data-reveal="true">Verifiable AI requires going beyond open weights. We offer granular transparency into our training code, training data composition, and evaluations. Inspect how K2 Horizon was built, reproduce it, then modify it.</p>
    
  </div>

  
